# ---------------------------------------------------------------
# Last Seen Wearing — Unity .gitignore
# Rule: Assets/, Packages/ and ProjectSettings/ are the project.
# Everything else is regenerated by Unity and must NOT be committed.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------

# Unity generated
/[Ll]ibrary/
/[Tt]emp/
/[Oo]bj/
/[Bb]uild/
/[Bb]uilds/
/[Ll]ogs/
/[Uu]ser[Ss]ettings/
/[Mm]emoryCaptures/
/[Rr]ecordings/

# Asset Store / package tooling
/[Aa]ssets/AssetStoreTools*
/[Aa]ssets/Plugins/Editor/JetBrains*

# Auto-generated solution and project files
*.csproj
*.unityproj
*.sln
*.suo
*.tmp
*.user
*.userprefs
*.pidb
*.booproj
*.svd
*.pdb
*.mdb
*.opendb
*.VC.db
.vsconfig

# IDE
/.vs/
/.idea/
/.gradle/
*.sublime-project
*.sublime-workspace

# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# Unity crash / build artefacts
sysinfo.txt
*.apk
*.aab
*.unitypackage
*.app
crashlytics-build.properties

# Player builds — derived output, never source
Builds/

# Addressables local build state (generated, machine specific)
/[Aa]ssets/[Aa]ddressable[Aa]ssets[Dd]ata/*/*.bin*
/[Aa]ssets/[Aa]ddressable[Aa]ssets[Dd]ata/link.xml*
# Addressables' per-platform build state. The .bin is covered above; the folder that holds
# it is generated by the player build too, so its .meta must go with it. Add a pair here for
# any new build target.
/[Aa]ssets/[Aa]ddressable[Aa]ssets[Dd]ata/[Ww]indows/
/[Aa]ssets/[Aa]ddressable[Aa]ssets[Dd]ata/[Ww]indows.meta
/[Ss]erver[Dd]ata/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------
# Personal, per-developer files — see docs/WORKFLOW.md
# TODO.md is each developer's own agenda. It is auto-created from
# TODO.template.md by Assets/_Project/Scripts/Editor/TodoBootstrap.cs
# ---------------------------------------------------------------
/TODO.md
